# MPC Sample coder lane

When the task touches **MPC Sample (AC50)**, **`.xpj`**, **`.xpm`**, **MPCTK**, **mpc-sample-sdk**, **Melodee**, **virtual-mpc-sample**, or **SD autorun**:

1. Read `docs/MPC_SAMPLE_ECOSYSTEM.md` and `disklordz/agents/profit/mpc-sample-coder/PLAYBOOK.md`.
2. Load fleet agent `disklordz/agents/profit/mpc-sample-coder/agent.md` and skill `disklordz-mpc-sample-coder`.
3. Run `python3 scripts/agent_memory.py recall --agent mpc-sample-coder <keywords>` at session start.
4. Do **not** mix Live `MPCVObject` keygroups with Sample `.xpj` without stating the target device.
5. Escalate Trap Lord / JUCE DSP to `vst-factory-director`; AGPL Melodee code is study-only for proprietary plugins.

Verify: `python3 disklordz/integrations/agents/mpc_sample_coder.py --self-test`.